olorid=3Dxk12r0d89p]{color:#97a0af} html[data-color-mode=3Ddark] [data-colo=
rid=3Dxk12r0d89p]{color:#505968}[data-colorid=3Dpmrllwpc9m]{color:#4c9aff} =
html[data-color-mode=3Ddark] [data-colorid=3Dpmrllwpc9m]{color:#004eb3}</st=
yle>:problem_statement: <span data-colorid=3D"crvlotic2e">Problem Statement=
</span></h2>
<p local-id=3D"23a86e03ebe2">Modern data platforms such as Databricks rely =
on dynamically scalable compute clusters to power ETL pipelines. The perfor=
mance, cost efficiency, and reliability of these workloads are directly tie=
d to how effectively clusters are configured. In practice, however, cluster=
 configurations are frequently set up incorrectly often due to limited expe=
rtise, manual guesswork, or the absence of automated tuning mechanisms. As =
a result, organizations experience performance degradation, unnecessary clo=
ud spending, operational instability, and reduced productivity for data tea=
ms. Industry benchmarks further highlight the scale of the issue: studies i=
ndicate that <strong>20% to 50%</strong> of total cloud spending is wasted =
on underutilized or poorly configured resources, making cloud waste a signi=
ficant source of financial loss for enterprises.</p>
<p local-id=3D"8974cb731e7a"><strong>Misconfigurations may involve:</strong=
></p>
<ul local-id=3D"599b7ed9-8f15-4fb5-9b6c-c1d41b5d8d57">
<li local-id=3D"598f724c-a184-43fe-b301-6e6f5343399f">
<p local-id=3D"676429c4731e">Under-provisioning / over-provisioning of clus=
ter resources</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"33f6f684-9694-445e-b822-0389fa669730">
<p local-id=3D"7fcc91c28d3e">Improper memory allocation</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d7b011e1-0b9b-40b8-bee4-9ccc9a94725b">
<p local-id=3D"b48a65292a27">Poorly tuned or inefficient autoscaling config=
urations</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b1d0859b-417a-4996-83b7-8ed4b59f1b78">
<p local-id=3D"e1b342097cda">Selection of suboptimal or high-cost node type=
s</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"643ed58270c7"><strong>These misconfigurations can lead to:</=
strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"e1877173-82b5-448c-8125-fcf93915adf0">
<li local-id=3D"0d0348e9-0a26-43ce-87d3-9b11ba3d667f">
<p local-id=3D"722e6341b7bf"><strong>Slow job execution and degraded perfor=
mance</strong>, including prolonged shuffle and stage execution times.</p><=
/li>
<li local-id=3D"0883e040-7fa9-4a0e-8792-b079c7af3941">
<p local-id=3D"a216ef0dab4d"><strong>Out-of-memory errors and job failures<=
/strong>, leading to delayed analytics and unstable pipelines.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c2d574ff-fef4-4268-8de1-3a568fcc4dbc">
<p local-id=3D"858b0319272a"><strong>Idle executors and underutilized compu=
te resources</strong>, resulting in poor overall cluster utilization.</p></=
li>
<li local-id=3D"d6a62dbe-8aa6-48b1-8e68-66e69da9480b">
<p local-id=3D"908efd5f6ec5"><strong>Increased DBU consumption and higher c=
loud VM costs</strong>, especially as workloads scale inefficiently.</p></l=
i>
</ul>
<h1 local-id=3D"efa9f55432b3" id=3D"CloudPulse-AIOptimizer-Objective">:obje=
ctive: <span data-colorid=3D"x1fk3qp2hj">Objective</span></h1>
<p local-id=3D"370a96d07f98">The primary objective is to systematically mit=
igate the performance, cost, and stability issues that stem from poorly con=
figured Databricks clusters. This project aims to deliver a smart and autom=
ated AI based solution that examines cluster behaviour, identifies ineffici=
encies, and recommends configurations tailored to specific workload require=
ments.</p>
<p local-id=3D"55138db1a664">Cloud Pulse is intended to:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"f8ebdf1c-7e59-448d-a36f-aff52639a705">
<li local-id=3D"00ae8f90-c49a-491d-b1a8-3ad39a03da9b">
<p local-id=3D"a2ed41141db2">Reduce performance bottlenecks caused by insuf=
ficient or poorly tuned compute resources</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5a57188c-2a38-4418-aa92-c6e824f9f98c">
<p local-id=3D"3e9b7cc46839">Prevent excessive cloud spending by eliminatin=
g over-provisioning and improving autoscaling decisions</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"009ba563-ff99-4751-8baa-337777791e08">
<p local-id=3D"f3558685cd4b">Enhance overall workload performance through s=
trengthened cluster stability.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"29a92e89-944b-4d7e-ac70-823a5acd344c">
<p local-id=3D"575d55320da4">Provide actionable, data-driven configuration =
recommendations for consistent and reliable optimization</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"589a052f763d">In essence, the goal of this project is to rem=
ove the risks and inefficiencies of manual or trial-and-error cluster tunin=
g, empowering organizations to achieve optimal performance, cost efficiency=
, and operational reliability across Databricks environments.</p>
<h1 local-id=3D"e1fb4f1a1e0c" id=3D"CloudPulse-AIOptimizer-Approach/Methodo=
logy">:approach_and_methodology:<strong><span data-colorid=3D"yg9zh94yph"> =
Approach/Methodology</span></strong></h1><span class=3D"confluence-embedded=
